// error
// Regression for #1701: a select comm that is neither a legal send (channel
// lhs) nor a legal receive (channel operand) must be rejected at check time,
// not silently accepted and left for `bit build` to refuse during lowering
// (#1693). `5 <- 3` parses identically in both compilers (explicit `<-`
// disambiguates it as send_stmt), so this shape pins the checker gap without
// touching the parsers' differing treatment of a bare comm expression.
function busyLoop(pingCh: chan<i64>) {
  select {
    case 5 <- 3:
      {}
  }
}
